# Citation metadata for the proposed OCSRE v1.0.0 research-framework release.
# Verify author attribution, repository URL, release date, and DOI before publication.
# No DOI or publication date is asserted in this pre-release metadata.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research framework, please cite the repository using
  the metadata in this file. Cite the version and DOI of the specific
  archived release when those identifiers become available.
title: 'Object-Centric Structural Reasoning and Evolution (OCSRE): Research Framework and Contracts'
type: software
abstract: >-
  A proposed object-centric structural intelligence research framework
  connecting typed object identity, metrics and perspectives, an Object
  Differential Kernel, contract-governed plugins, bounded reasoning,
  SQL-to-object semantic adaptation, in-situ feedback, WE-native
  Constrained Delta Evolution, SIF localization, capability relay, and
  open-ended structural evolution. The v1.0.0 baseline presents research
  papers, specifications, illustrative cases, and validation protocols;
  it does not assert a validated implementation or confirmed scaling law.
